  "title": "Sun Xinran, 16, stuns Bucsa in Beijing for first Top 50 win; to face Gauff next",
  "description": "Junior World No. 1 Sun Xinran continued her home-soil breakthrough at the China Open on Saturday, The 16-year-old wild card came from a break down in the second set to upset No. 27 seed Cristina Bucsa 6-4, 7-5, notching her first career Top 50 win and becoming the first 2010-born player to reach the third round of a WTA 1000 event. She will next face No. 3 seed Coco Gauff.",
